        <div class="hopt-tradeoffs">
          <div class="hopt-tradeoff">
            <h3>Pros</h3>
            <p>Most editorial / premium-product. Video is a deliberate composed asset. Header never touches the
            video — they live in different visual zones. Plays well with the existing card system across the site.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="hopt-tradeoff">
            <h3>Cons</h3>
            <p>Loses the most vertical real estate (header + page-bg gutter). Hero feels smaller. Less
            "billboard" impact than full-bleed. Margins around the card cost ~40px on each side.</p>
