      <!-- =================== OPTION 5 =================== -->
      <article class="hopt-option">
        <div class="hopt-label">
          <span class="hopt-num">Option 05 · NEW</span>
          <h2 class="hopt-title">Full-bleed + Header Safe-zone — no video content lost</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="hopt-desc">
          Full-bleed video, edge to edge. The video's <code>object-position</code> is shifted to <strong>50% 72%</strong>
          so the meaningful framing (paddy, horizon, flame) sits in the lower 70%; the natural sky/blank area at the top
          becomes a "safe zone" for the header. A soft 110px gradient gives header text its legibility band without
          adding any visible chrome. Header is fully transparent — paper text + saffron CTA float on the fade.
          Result: full-bleed video AND nothing important hidden behind the header.
        </p>

        <div class="hopt-frame">
          <div class="hopt-chrome"><span class="hopt-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span class="hopt-url">kalasagar.github.io/sree-veeranjaneya-green-energy/</span></div>
          <div class="hopt-stage">
