        <p class="hopt-desc">
          Same full-bleed framing as Option 05, but every hero video has been re-encoded with a <strong>120px mirrored-blurred top extension</strong>
          (filter chain: <code>crop top 120px → vflip → gaussian-blur → vstack on top of original</code>). The video file
          is now <code>1280×840</code> instead of <code>1280×720</code>; the original frame sits below an organic-feeling
          "sky pad" that color-matches the scene. Header lives entirely on the extension band — guaranteed never to
